                    <article>
                        <div id="main" class="clearfix">
                            <!--==h1 Start=============================================-->
                            <div class="h1-area">
                                <div class="h1-area-in">
                                    <h1>Housing Information -Dormitories-</h1>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <hr>
                            <!--//h1-area-->
                            <!--==//h1 End===========================================-->

                            

                            <!--==Main Contents Start=====================================================================-->
                            <div class="main-contents">

                                
                                                                                
            

                                                <!--==1Column Start========================================-->
    <div class="column-area">
        <div class="column1 clearfix">
            <div class="column-box clearfix">
                <!--//ここから1カラム//////////////////////-->
                                                    <!--==Text Area Start===========-->
    <div class="txt-area clearfix clear">
        <div class="txt-area-in clearfix ">
            All exchange students are required to live in our dormitories. Please go through the information on each housing facility and choose the dormitory that best suits your needs!<br />
You will be asked which dormitory you wish to stay in at the time of application. However the International Office will decide which dormitory you will be placed in and will not accept requests for changes afterwards. We will do our best to allocate you to your first or second choice, but there is a possibility that you may be allocated to a third choice due to capacity.
        </div>
    </div><!--//txt-area-->
    <!--==//Text Area End===========-->

            
                <!--//ここまで1カラム//////////////////////-->
            </div>
            <!--//column-box-->
        </div>
        <!--//column1-->
    </div><!--//column-area-->
    <!--==//1Column End========================================-->

                                                <!--==1Column Start========================================-->
    <div class="column-area">
        <div class="column1 clearfix">
            <div class="column-box clearfix">
                <!--//ここから1カラム//////////////////////-->
                                                            <!--==h2 Start================-->
        <div class="h2-area">
            <div class="h2-area-in">
                <h2 id="2cc88e21">NUFS International House (I-House)</h2>
            </div>
        </div><!--//h2-area-->
        <!--==//h2 End================-->
    
                                            <!--==Text Area Start===========-->
    <div class="txt-area clearfix clear">
        <div class="txt-area-in clearfix ">
            There are about 60 rooms in a two-storey building with a central hall and courtyard. All rooms are private and each room has its own bathroom. The kitchen is shared. As every step out of a private room opens onto the hall, interaction between residents is easy and active.
        </div>
    </div><!--//txt-area-->
    <!--==//Text Area End===========-->

                                                    <!--==h3 Start================-->
        <div class="h3-area">
            <div class="h3-area-in">
                <h3>Specifics</h3>
            </div>
        </div><!--//h3-area-->
        <!--==//h3 End================-->
    
                                            <!--==Text+Image Area Start===========-->
    <div class="txt-img-area clearfix clear">
                    
                                        
                                        
                                        
            <div class="img-area photo-right photo-normal clearfix">
                                    <p class="img"><img src="https://www-e.nufs.ac.jp/media/20180725-125202-158.jpg" alt=""/></p>
                                <div class="cap"><p
                            class="cap-l"></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        
        <div class="tx-area"><ul class="contents-list-ul"><li>Type: University dormitory for international students</li><li>Application and maintenance fee: ￥10,000 (upon move-in only, Non-refundable)</li><li>Room Rent: ￥35,000 (including utilities)*</li><li>Rental Bedding: Available (￥6,000+tax /once only)*</li><li>Kitchen: Communal (tableware not included)</li><li>Bathroom: Not Communal (shower and toilet in each room)</li><li>Internet: Free Wi-Fi</li><li>Laundry Facilities: Communal (￥100 per cycle)</li><li>Furniture: Fully furnished</li><li>To/From NUFS: 5 minutes’ walk</li><li>Address: 37-39 Takenoyama, Iwasaki, Nisshin, Aichi, 470-0131</li></ul></ul><br />
　*May be subject to change<br />
<br />
</div>

    </div><!--//txt-img-area-->
    <!--==//Text+Image Area End===========-->

                                            <!--==HTML Area Start===========-->
    <div class="html-area clearfix clear">
        <div class="html-area-in clearfix ">
            <iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Oyxb_z8ouqE" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
    </div><!--//html-area-->
    <!--==//HTML Area End===========-->

                                            <!--==Text Area Start===========-->
    <div class="txt-area clearfix clear">
        <div class="txt-area-in clearfix ">
            <br />

        </div>
    </div><!--//txt-area-->
    <!--==//Text Area End===========-->

            
                <!--//ここまで1カラム//////////////////////-->
            </div>
            <!--//column-box-->
        </div>
        <!--//column1-->
    </div><!--//column-area-->
    <!--==//1Column End========================================-->

