                                <div class="cap"><p
                            class="cap-c"></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        
        <div class="tx-area"><ul class="contents-list-ul"><li>Type: University dormitory for international students</li><li>Application and maintenance fee: ￥10,000 (upon move-in only, Non-refundable)</li><li>Room Rent: ￥35,000 (including utilities)*</li><li>Rental Bedding: Available (￥6,000+tax/once only)*</li><li>Kitchen: Not Communal (kitchen in each room, kitchenware and tableware not included)</li><li>Bathroom: Not Communal (shower and toilet in each room)</li><li>Internet: Free Wi-Fi</li><li>Laundry Facilities: Not Communal (washing machine in each room)</li><li>Furniture: Fully furnished</li><li>To/From NUFS: 5 minutes’ walk</li><li>Address: 1-301 Takenoyama, Nisshin, Aichi, 470-0136</li></ul><br />
